# The offline edition's Windows build (`pnpm desktop:exe:offline`, `vite build --mode offline`):
# the page talks to app://gym-spa/server/…, which the Windows app forwards to the gym's server PC
# (README → Offline edition). Every value here is public; nothing secret belongs in this file.
VITE_EDITION=offline
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=app://gym-spa/server
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_gym-spa-offline
